This product includes a port of the Attention Manifest Protocol (AMP v0.1),
originally published in the attention-manifest-protocol project
(https://github.com/eloyhere/attention-manifest-protocol), version 0.4.1,
Copyright 2026 Eloy Kim, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The port lives in `src/protocol/` and `src/host/amp-store.ts` / `src/host/amp.ts`.
It re-implements the protocol's normative artifacts against this repository's
runtime; the wire shapes, invariants and rejection vocabulary are taken from the
reference implementation, while the implementation language and host bindings
(Ed25519 through `node:crypto`, SQLite persistence, ISO-8601 timestamps) differ.
`docs/amp-conformance.md` records which artifacts are wired, which are kernel-only
and which are deliberately not implemented.
